                // SCE_MESH.md §9.6 — remote <invoke type="scxml" src="#peer">
                // Emits wire-14 `InvokeStart`; the child's worker host
                // answers with wire-15 `InvokeStarted` (→ onInvokeStarted
                // stashes the session URI), events during the child's life
                // arrive as wire-16 `ChildEvent` (→ raiseExternal with
                // `_event.origin = child_session_id` per §9.6.3), and final
