                            "scxml invoke '{{ invoke_info.invoke_id }}' to '#{{ invoke_info.remote_mesh_target }}': SESSION_F_TRANSPORT_UNAVAILABLE per SCE_MESH.md §9.6/§10.7.1 — no mesh transport binding to peer device"));
